00/extras/571b87696f40f01463721938bf55a8b4.webm?t=1772014843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/571b87696f40f01463721938bf55a8b4.mp4?t=1772014843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Diplomacy to Mediate, Force to Suppress Evil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duties go beyond battle. Solve the underworld's daily chaos such as feed a hungry Yaoguai, help a misplaced god or untangle a fox spirit in his cultivation... A top-tier envoy masters both the pen and the blade. Ready to negotiate peace or clear the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/806674375df2cee5cb5cb9293e4d456a.poster.avif?t=1772014843\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/806674375df2cee5cb5cb9293e4d456a.webm?t=1772014843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/806674375df2cee5cb5cb9293e4d456a.mp4?t=1772014843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game designers are committed to providing players with fresh, timely and interesting gameplay. We highly value feedback from all players and are committed to improving the game for everyone.  Your valuable ideas can help us to optimize the quality of Reap and Rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/508c3f02507e88b488